          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "digtoonaada, yaan dabin laydinku qabsan si aad iyaga u raacdaan, markii iyaga hortiinna laga baabbi'iyo ka dib, oo ha haybsanina ilaahyadooda oo ha odhanina, War quruumahanu sidee bay ugu adeegaan ilaahyadooda? Annana sidaas oo kalaannu yeelaynaaye. ",
          "type": "text",
