        },
        {
          "text": "Waa inaydaan Rabbiga Ilaahiinna ah saas ku samayn, maxaa yeelay, wax kasta oo Rabbigu karahsado oo uu neceb yahay ayay iyagu ilaahyadooda ku sameeyaan, oo xataa wiilashooda iyo gabdhahooda bay u gubaan ilaahyadooda.",
          "type": "text",
